#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.NEEDSFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.NEEDSFUEL"
