msgstr "すみません…ちょっと…？んー、忙しいのかな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS"
msgid "It would be a pretty short game, maybe I should find more first."
msgstr "すぐに決着がついちゃいそうだから、まずはもっとコニャライグマを探そうっと。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS"
msgid "Uhh, I'm not sure where they could even hide around here."
msgstr "うーん…ここら辺だとどこにも隠れられそうにないなぁ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY"
