msgstr "子ねこたち、ごめんね。僕は一日中遊べるわけじゃないんだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
