msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK"
msgid "Huh? My punches feel wimpier... not that I was wimpy before!"
msgstr "ん？パンチ力が弱くなってる…僕が弱いってことじゃないよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK"
msgid "Darnit... guess the show's over."
msgstr "ちぇっ…ここでショーも終わりか。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY"
msgid "Oh well. It's good to stay hydrated anyway."
msgstr "あらら。まっ、水分補給は大事だよね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION"
msgid "Back to regular Walter."
msgstr "いつものウォルターに元通り。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE"
msgid "I'm starting to get a bit tired..."
msgstr "ちょっと疲れてきちゃった…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS"
msgid "Alright, time for a break."
msgstr "よし、そろそろ休憩しないとね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "That should help... I think."
msgstr "これで大丈夫…だと思うけど。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_DUSK"
msgid "It's getting late, better set up camp soon."
msgstr "暗くなってきた…すぐにキャンプを設置しないと。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Being outdoors makes everything taste better!"
msgstr "外で食べると何でも美味しいや！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID"
msgid "I don't think that's safe to eat."
msgstr "これは食べていいものかな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL"
msgid "Oooh... my stomach hurts..."
msgstr "うう…お腹が痛い…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED"
msgid "Ugh, what did I just eat?"
msgstr "ううっ、何か変なモノ食べたっけ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE"
msgid "I think that was old..."
msgstr "古くなっていたみたい…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY"
msgid "Even Woby wouldn't eat that."
msgstr "ウォービーだって食べないよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING"
msgid "Hey everybody! Time to eat!"
msgstr "やあみんな！食事の時間だよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED"
msgid "Refreshing!"
msgstr "気持ちいい！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION"
msgid "It's the best of both worlds!"
msgstr "どっちの世界にとってもお得だね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED"
msgid "I bet I could carry you, Woby!"
msgstr "ウォービー、僕が運んであげるよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER"
msgid "I don't think my tummy can handle that."
msgstr "僕のお腹じゃ耐えられないとおもう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1"
msgid "A Pinetree Pioneer... never gives up...!"
msgstr "マツワケ隊は…諦めない…！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2"
msgid "This is... ergh... a little heavy..."
msgstr "これ…ちょっと…重い…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3"
msgid "Woby... could you... help... at all...?"
msgstr "ウォービー…ちょっと…手伝ってくれる…？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4"
msgid "I'll get it...! I just... need a minute...!"
msgstr "僕ならできる…！少し時間が…いるだけ…！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5"
msgid "This can't... be good... for my spine..."
msgstr "こんな負担…背骨に…良くない…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6"
msgid "Come on Wobyyyy... help me... out!"
msgstr "ねえ、ウォービーィィ…たすけ…て！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7"
msgid "I can... do it...!"
msgstr "僕なら…できる…！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8"
msgid "Errgh... just... give me a minute..."
msgstr "うぐぐ…あと少し…待って…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.9"
msgid "Why am I... doing this... again...?"
msgstr "何で…こんなこと…またしてるの…？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_DOWNGRADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_DOWNGRADE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_SIDEGRADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_SIDEGRADE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_UPGRADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_UPGRADE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK"
msgid "Ohh, verrry spooooky!"
msgstr "うわ、すっごく不気味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT"
msgid "Oh, hey! I can see again!"
msgstr "あ！また見えるようになった！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB"
msgid "That was not fun."
msgstr "楽しくなかったね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE"
msgid "I'm pretty sure that's supposed to be attached to something!"
msgstr "これきっと、何かに取り付けられてるはずだよね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY"
msgid "Aww wait, come back!"
msgstr "ねぇ、待ってよ～！戻ってきて！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK"
msgid "Oh good, they came back!"
msgstr "やったね、アイツら戻ってきたよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT"
msgid "Guess it's time for a new fan."
msgstr "新しい扇風機に替えないと。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED"
msgid "I didn't know there was so much to learn about this stuff."
msgstr "こんなにたくさん勉強しなくちゃいけないなんて知らなかったよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.1"
msgid "Ah! Ow! It burns!!"
msgstr "あ！大変！燃えてる！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.2"
msgid "Aaaah, it got me! It got me!"
msgstr "あいたた！やられたよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE"
msgid "Whew... I-I think I'm okay now."
msgstr "はー…もうだいじょうぶ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN"
msgid "A signal! We should follow it!"
msgstr "信号だ！あそこを目指して進もう！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD"
msgid "I knew I'd come out on top!"
msgstr "波に乗ったよ！最高潮！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO"
msgid "Submerging!"
msgstr "沈んでる！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED"
msgid "I gotta paws. Get it, Wobes?"
msgstr "足が棒になっちゃうよ…ウォービー、意味わかる？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FOODMEMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FOODMEMORY"
msgid "only_used_by_warly"
msgstr "only_used_by_warly"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM"
msgid "That wasn't nearly as fun as I thought it'd be..."
msgstr "思ってたより全然楽しくなかったよ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr "only_used_by_wurt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN"
msgid "My head... I thought having ghosts around would be more fun."
msgstr "頭が…幽霊がいるってもっと楽しいかと思ってた。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED"
msgid "Huh. Is it just me, or does the atmosphere in here feel lighter?"
msgstr "あれ、気のせいかな？なんだか雰囲気が明るくなった気がするよ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_ACIDBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_ACIDBUFF_DONE"
msgid "Hold on Woby, I think my Acid Repellent is wearing off."
msgstr "待って、ウォービー。酸よけの効果が切れそうだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE"
msgid "I've got to be careful, Woby. My Thermal Balm has worn off."
msgstr "ウォービー、気を付けよう。サーモバームの効果が切れちゃったよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE"
msgid "We're here, Wobes!"
msgstr "到着したよ、ウォービー！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT"
msgid "Aw, it didn't work!"
msgstr "あれれ、上手くいかないぞ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH"
msgid "I know everything now! Mostly everything, at least."
msgstr "全て分かったぞ！ほとんど全て、だけど。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HOT"
msgid "Whew... come on Woby, we'd better find some shade."
msgstr "ふう…おいでウォービー、陰に移動しよう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS"
msgid "Woby? Do you hear something?"
msgstr "ウォービー？何か聞こえた？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY"
msgid "Can we stop for a snack break?"
msgstr "少し止まってご飯休憩する？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_AVOID_FORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_AVOID_FORK"
msgid "Aww, but the other trail looks so much more exciting..."
msgstr "ああ、でもこっちの道はもっとエキサイティングな感じがする…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY"
msgid "I learned all about tracking in the Pioneers! It went thataway!"
msgstr "追跡の仕方はマツワケ隊で習ったよ！獲物はこっちだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL"
msgid "I uh... think I lost the trail..."
msgstr "えっと…跡を見失ったみたい…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING"
msgid "There's too many footprints in this wet ground!"
msgstr "ぬかるみで足跡がべちゃべちゃだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_START_FORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_START_FORK"
msgid "This trail could be dangerous, but a Pinetree Pioneer has no fear!"
msgstr "この道はアブナイかもしれないけど、マツワケ隊は恐れないんだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_SUCCESSFUL_FORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_SUCCESSFUL_FORK"
msgid "Don't worry Woby, we're gonna catch them by surprise!"
msgstr "大丈夫だ、ウォービー、奴らに奇襲をかけてやる！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_WRONG_FORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_WRONG_FORK"
msgid "Huh... I have the weirdest feeling something's watching me."
msgstr "ううん…何かが僕を見てるような気がするんだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER"
msgid "I think it needs more nutrients."
msgstr "養分が足りないみたい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL"
msgid "I already have too many supplies to carry."
msgstr "物資が多くてもう持てないよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_IS_FEASTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_IS_FEASTING"
msgid "Don't worry Woby, I'll save some for you!"
msgstr "心配しないでウォービー、少し取っておいてあげる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_FOUND_IN_THE_WILD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_FOUND_IN_THE_WILD"
msgid "Woby! Look what I found!"
msgstr "ウォービー！見て！この子を見つけたんだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.1"
msgid "I knew I'd find you!"
msgstr "見つけられると思ってたよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.2"
msgid "There you are!"
msgstr "みーつけた！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.3"
msgid "Gotcha!"
msgstr "みーっけ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.4"
msgid "That was too easy."
msgstr "よゆーだね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE"
msgid "I think that's all of them!"
msgstr "これでみんな見つけたはず！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE_TEAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE_TEAM"
msgid "Good job {name}, I think that's the last one!"
msgstr "{name}さん、よくやったね！その子で最後だと思うよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_ONE_MORE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_ONE_MORE"
msgid "There should be one more hiding somewhere..."
msgstr "もう1匹どこかに隠れてるはずなんだけどなぁ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_LOSEGAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_LOSEGAME"
msgid "Darnit, they're too good at hiding!"
msgstr "もう！みんな隠れるの上手すぎ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP"
msgid "Uh oh, I think we're almost out of time."
msgstr "やばい、もう時間がないよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR"
msgid "I don't think they'd be hiding way out here."
msgstr "こんな遠くに隠れてるわけないと思うんだよね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR_RETURN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR_RETURN"
msgid "I think we're getting warmer, Woby!"
msgstr "もう少しで見つけられるよね、ウォービー！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_JOIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_JOIN"
msgid "Can I play too? Uh... I mean, use my Pioneer tracking expertise?"
msgstr "僕も遊んでいい？あっ…じゃなくて、僕のマツワケ隊の追跡能力を披露したいんだけどいいかな？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_START"
msgid "Alright, I'm closing my eyes! Three... two... one...!"
msgstr "よーし、目をつぶるからね！…はーち…きゅーう…じゅっ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP"
msgid "He's calling more monsters! YES!!"
msgstr "他のモンスターを呼んでるみたいだ！やった！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE"
msgid "I think we made him angry."
msgstr "怒らせちゃったみたい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED"
msgid "Maybe he'll feel better with that chain gone."
msgstr "鎖から解放されて快適なんじゃないかな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT"
msgid "W-Woby...? Oooh... what happened?"
msgstr "ウ、ウォービー…？うぅ…何が起きたの？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED"
msgid "Woah! I almost got zapped!"
msgstr "うわぁ！もう少しで当たるところだった！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND"
msgid "Woby, did you see that hand? It's cheating!"
msgstr "ウォービー、今の手見た？ズルしてたよね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH"
msgid "That wasn't very informative."
msgstr "あんまりためにならなかったな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING"
msgid "Incoming... again?"
msgstr "もう一回…来るの？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES"
msgid "They're falling from the sky, Woby!"
msgstr "ウォービー、鳥たちが空から落ちてくる！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS"
msgid "Those poor birds!"
msgstr "鳥たち、かわいそう！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LUNAR_RIFT_MAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LUNAR_RIFT_MAX"
msgid "Look, Woby! Something's glowing over there!"
msgstr "見て、ウォービー！あっちで何か光ってるよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS"
msgid "Ha! Of course we only get a pair, Woby! They're chess pieces!"
msgstr "うん、一組しか手に入らないに決まってるよ、ウォービー！だって、これチェスの駒なんだから！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MEGA_FLARE_SEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MEGA_FLARE_SEEN"
msgid "Wow, it's hard to miss a signal that bright!"
msgstr "わあ、これだけ明るかったら見逃すわけないよね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.1"
msgid "I-is it getting hot in here...?"
msgstr "あ、あれ？だんだん熱くなってきてる…？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.2"
msgid "I feel so hot, I-I might have a fever..."
msgstr "すっごく熱いよ。ぼ、僕、熱が出ちゃったのかな…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE"
msgid "I-it's okay, Woby. I'm feeling better now!"
msgstr "だ、大丈夫だよ、ウォービー。だいぶ気分がよくなってきたから！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_1"
msgid "All of a sudden I can't stop thinking about bananas..."
msgstr "急にバナナのことが頭から離れなくなったんだ..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGE"
msgid "Uhh, something really weird is happening!"
msgstr "うわぁ、何か変なことが起きているぞ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGEBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGEBACK"
msgid "Woby, c'mere girl! It's okay, I'm me again!"
msgstr "ウォービー、おいで！大丈夫、元の僕に戻ったから！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_LOW"
msgid "Just a little more..."
msgstr "あともう少し…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_MED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_MED"
msgid "Woby look! There's something in there!"
msgstr "ウォービー、見て！何かあるよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_REVEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_REVEAL"
msgid "Got it! What is it?"
msgstr "やった！これは何だろう？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_LOW"
msgid "Just a little more..."
msgstr "あともう少し…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_MED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_MED"
msgid "Woby look! There's something in there!"
msgstr "ウォービー、見て！何かあるよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL"
msgid "Got it! What is it?"
msgstr "やった！これは何だろう？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW"
msgid "Just a little more..."
msgstr "あともう少し…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED"
msgid "Woby look! There's something in there!"
msgstr "ウォービー、見て！何かあるよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_REVEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_REVEAL"
msgid "Got it! What is it?"
msgstr "やった！これは何だろう？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED"
msgid "Darnit, I must've done something wrong..."
msgstr "もう、どこかで間違ったんだ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS"
msgid "Zhey vant to suck our bloood!"
msgstr "僕らの血を吸う気だ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH"
msgid "Oh. I think they're hurt."
msgstr "ケガしてるみたい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL"
msgid "Woby, look at those weird buzzards!"
msgstr "ウォービー、見てよ！あの変なハゲワシ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT"
msgid "There's monsters around! I don't want to miss anything!"
msgstr "近くにモンスターがいる！これは見逃せないぞ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA"
msgid "This isn't the best time for a siesta."
msgstr "昼寝をしてる場合じゃないね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP"
msgid "I'm not scared! I just can't sleep..."
msgstr "ビビッてないよ！眠くないだけ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP"
msgid "I can't sleep with the sun in my eyes."
msgstr "お日様が出てると眠れないよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE"
msgid "I can't sleep now!"
msgstr "今は眠れないよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA"
msgid "Maybe if I have a snack first."
msgstr "先に何か食べたいな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP"
msgid "I can't sleep on an empty stomach..."
msgstr "腹ペコじゃ眠れないよ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT"
msgid "I'll have to get down first."
msgstr "まずは下に降りないと。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA"
msgid "I'd rather just go to bed."
msgstr "それよりベッドに入りたいな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE"
msgid "I can't rest now! There's too much to look at down here!"
msgstr "ここでは休めないよ！気になるものが多すぎる！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE"
msgid "Do I still get the badge?"
msgstr "これでもバッジはもらえる？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPHASPERMANENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPHASPERMANENTLIGHT"
msgid "Um, WX? Could you maybe turn the light down a bit?"
msgstr "あー…WX。光を少し弱くしてくれない？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE"
msgid "Um... that's on fire."
msgstr "うーん…燃えてる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE"
msgid "That seems like a bad idea."
msgstr "悪い予感がするよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NO_ABIGAIL_FLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NO_ABIGAIL_FLOWER"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP"
msgid "Huh. I thought for sure there would be a trap."
msgstr "あれ、絶対に罠があると思ったのに。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST"
msgid "Er... that was just for practice."
msgstr "あー…今のはただの練習だもん。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY"
msgid "Hey! No fair!"
msgstr "ちょっと！そんなのないよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1"
msgid "Hmm-hm hmmm, hm-de-dum..."
msgstr "ふんふんふ～ん…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2"
msgid "Well. I'm kind of bored."
msgstr "飽きてきちゃった。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3"
msgid "Do you think we should try somewhere else Woby?"
msgstr "ウォービー、場所を変えた方がいいかな？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4"
msgid "I wonder if fish tell scary stories about us?"
msgstr "魚同士でも僕らが出てくる怖い話をするのかな？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP"
msgid "Darnit!"
msgstr "もうっ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE"
msgid "Just reel it in a little... just like they taught us..."
msgstr "少し糸を引こう…教えられた通りに…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING"
msgid "Is that a real sea monster?"
msgstr "あれが海のモンスター？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT"
msgid "Uh, I don't think that's in the script..."
msgstr "えっと、台本になかったと思うんだけど…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN"
msgid "I knew we shouldn't have gotten rid of that den..."
msgstr "あの巣を壊すべきじゃなかったんだ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS"
msgid "Get ready to swim Woby, I don't think this was made for deep water!"
msgstr "泳ぐ準備はいい、ウォービー？これで深いところに行っちゃいけなかったんだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PECKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PECKED"
msgid "Ouch!! Th-that hurt!"
msgstr "うわ！！い、痛いよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES"
msgid "I scream, you scream, the trees scream!"
msgstr "僕も、君も、木も、みんな大騒ぎだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "I'm pretty sure that's not how it's supposed to look."
msgstr "こんな姿じゃないはずだけど。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE"
msgid "What's that music? Did someone bring a radio?"
msgstr "あの音楽は何だろ？誰かラジオを持ってきたのかな？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED"
msgid "Let's see what grows, Woby!"
msgstr "ウォービー、何が育つか見てみよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1"
msgid "More plant facts for my mental handbook!"
msgstr "心のハンドブックに植物の情報が増えた！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL"
msgid "Look at us, Woby! We're officially time travelers!!"
msgstr "見て見て、ウォービー！僕たち公式のタイムトラベラーだよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID"
msgid "Woby, run!"
msgstr "ウォービー、逃げるよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE"
msgid "Did you feel that, Woby?"
msgstr "揺れたよね、ウォービー？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT"
msgid "Why won't it work here?"
msgstr "なんでダメなんだろ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE"
msgid "Woby, do you hear digging? Sounds angry!"
msgstr "ウォービー、掘ってる音聞こえる？怒ってるみたいじゃない！？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY"
msgid "Look at that rabbit, Woby!"
msgstr "ウォービー、見てよあのウサギ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT"
msgid "Gotcha!"
msgstr "みーっけ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE"
msgid "Something's digging underground!"
msgstr "何かが地下を掘ってるよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED"
msgid "Look at those defenses! how does he do that?"
msgstr "すごいディフェンスだ！どうやったんだろう？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH"
msgid "I memorized my Pinetree Pioneer handbook, I can memorize this!"
msgstr "マツワケ隊のハンドブックを暗記したんだ…これだって暗記できる！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE"
msgid "Aaah... I don't want to do that again."
msgstr "うう…もう1度なんて嫌だよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE"
msgid "You look better already!"
msgstr "もう顔色も良さそうだね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE"
msgid "Don't worry! I have a badge in first aid!"
msgstr "大丈夫！応急処置バッジは持ってるから！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.1"
msgid "Hey! Nice crown!"
msgstr "わあ！ステキな王冠だね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.2"
msgid "How bee-fitting!"
msgstr "似合いすぎて、笑顔がハチきれちゃうよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.3"
msgid "Your Majesty."
msgstr "陛下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.1"
msgid "Wow! Nice \"crown\"."
msgstr "おお！かっこいい「王冠」！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.2"
msgid "It's jest perfect!"
msgstr "これはウケがいいよ！ド級のウケ、まさにドウケだね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.3"
msgid "Your \"Majesty\"."
msgstr "「陛下」だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET"
msgid "Hey Woby, look! The monsters are back!"
msgstr "見て、ウォービー！モンスターが戻ってきたよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO"
msgid "This thing is impossible to open!"
msgstr "全然開かないよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES"
msgid "That wasn't hard at all."
msgstr "余裕だったね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL"
msgid "I've already filled out my scrapbook."
msgstr "もうスクラップブックは埋めちゃったよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING"
msgid "We have a new buddy, Woby!"
msgstr "ウォービー、新しい仲間ができたよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH"
msgid "Yikes! What bit me, Woby?"
msgstr "うわ！ウォービー、僕、何に噛まれたんだろ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX"
msgid "What was that weird light? We should check it out, Woby!"
msgstr "あの変な光は何？ウォービー、確かめに行こうよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER"
msgid "What would we do without trees?"
msgstr "木がないのにどうしたらいいの？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_BLOSSOM"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_EVIL"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SLINGHSOT_NO_AMMO_SKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SLINGHSOT_NO_AMMO_SKILL"
msgid "This ammo is tricky."
msgstr "この弾は使うのが難しいね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SLINGHSOT_NO_PARTS_SKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SLINGHSOT_NO_PARTS_SKILL"
msgid "Huh. How does this part work?"
msgstr "うーん、この部品、どうやって使おう？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SLINGHSOT_OUT_OF_AMMO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SLINGHSOT_OUT_OF_AMMO.1"
msgid "Uh oh... I'm all out of ammo."
msgstr "おっと…弾が切れちゃった。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SLINGHSOT_OUT_OF_AMMO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SLINGHSOT_OUT_OF_AMMO.2"
msgid "Uh... just kidding!"
msgstr "えっと…なーんちゃって！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SNARED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SNARED"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "ちょっと！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY"
msgid "Hey, let me go!"
msgstr "いやだ！放して！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW"
msgid "We've run out of snow, Woby!"
msgstr "雪がなくなっちゃったよ、ウォービー！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG"
msgid "It won't get any bigger!"
msgstr "これ以上は大きくならないよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED"
msgid "I'm going to get all pruney!"
msgstr "体がふやけちゃう！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED"
msgid "Yikes! That gave me quite the start!"
msgstr "うわあぁ～！こんな歓迎はないよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_STORYTELLING_ABORT_FIREWENTOUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_STORYTELLING_ABORT_FIREWENTOUT.1"
msgid "Darnit, the fire went out right at the best part!"
msgstr "もう、いいところで火が消えちゃった！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_STORYTELLING_ABORT_NOT_NIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_STORYTELLING_ABORT_NOT_NIGHT.1"
msgid "To be continued..."
msgstr "次回につづく…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1"
msgid "Hey! Do you guys want to hear a story?"
msgstr "ねえ、おもしろいこと聞きたい？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2"
msgid "You're doing great, plants! Keep it up!"
msgstr "すごくよくやってるよ、みんな！その調子その調子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll be here to talk to you whenever you get lonely."
msgstr "心配しなくても大丈夫。きみが寂しくなったらここに来て話し相手になってあげるよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4"
msgid "How are you doing today plants? Seen any new bugs lately?"
msgstr "植物のみなさん、今日はご機嫌いかが？最近新しい虫を見かけた？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5"
msgid "It's good to have someone to talk to. Thanks plants!"
msgstr "話し相手がいるっていいな。ありがとうね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_THORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_THORNS"
msgid "Aaah!! Ow!! It hurts! Were those poisonous?!"
msgstr "うわあ！！ひぇっ！痛いよ！毒持ちじゃないよね！？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT"
msgid "I think it's out of fuel."
msgstr "燃料切れみたい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED"
msgid "I think Woby and I can sniff them out on our own."
msgstr "ウォービーと僕なら自分たちでみんなのにおいをたどれるよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD"
msgid "I-it's okay Woby, he's just taking a nap! Let's keep going."
msgstr "だ、大丈夫だよ、ウォービー。この子はただお昼寝してるだけだから！さあ、先に進もう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION"
msgid "Look Woby, I think he's trying to get our attention!"
msgstr "見て、ウォービー！あの子、僕たちの気を引こうとしてるみたい！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON"
msgid "I guess he lost the scent."
msgstr "においが途切れちゃったみたいだね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON"
msgid "I think he smells something nearby!"
msgstr "何か近くのにおいを感じ取ったみたいだよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "It doesn't look like he's picking up any scents."
msgstr "何のにおいもしないみたいだね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING"
msgid "I think he knows the way!"
msgstr "どっちに行けばいいか知ってるみたいだよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER"
msgid "Wait up! I'm coming!"
msgstr "待って！今行くから！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED"
msgid "Darnit... he got away."
msgstr "もう…逃げられちゃった。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING"
msgid "Hey wait! Come back!"
msgstr "ちょっと待って！戻ってきて！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP"
msgid "I- I meant to do that!"
msgstr "ぼ、僕がやるはずだったのに！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK"
msgid "It's okay Woby, we just need to find a stronger tool!"
msgstr "大丈夫だよ、ウォービー。もっと強い道具を探せばいいだけさ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT"
msgid "Uh oh... this is usually the part when something bad happens."
msgstr "うわー…このシチュエーションだとたいてい悪いことが起こるんだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT"
msgid "Do you think I'll be the same person when I come out the other side?"
msgstr "反対側から出てきても僕は僕のままかな？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF"
msgid "It looked way easier in my handbook..."
msgstr "ハンドブックだと簡単そうだったのにな…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "I don't think it's done yet."
msgstr "これ、もう完成してるとは思えない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST"
msgid "Wait a minute! They're helping us, Woby!"
msgstr "待って！ウォービー、あの子たちは手伝ってくれるんだよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING"
msgid "I don't know, Woby! Must be a bad connection!"
msgstr "ウォービー、僕どうしたらいいか分からないよ！たぶん接続状況が悪いんだと思う！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE"
msgid "Woby...? Oh good, you're okay!"
msgstr "ウォービー…？よかった、無事だね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT"
msgid "This carrat doesn't look healthy..."
msgstr "この子、体調が悪そうだよ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK"
msgid "We need something stronger, Woby!"
msgstr "ウォービー、もっと強いのが必要だね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT"
msgid "Weight: {weight}"
msgstr "重さ：{weight}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT_HEAVY"
