#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED"
