msgstr "ボニュイ、こんばんは。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER"
