msgstr "中でヒナが育ってるヨ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
