#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT"
