#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURPER"
msgid "Simple creatures. They exist only to sleep and feed."
msgstr "シンプルな生き物。寝食のためだけに存在する。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT"
msgid "In death, this creature will serve me!"
msgstr "死んで役に立ってもらおう！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT"
msgid "In death, this creature will serve me!"
msgstr "死んだら、この生き物が役に立ってくれる！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE"
msgid "I don't remember those..."
msgstr "それは覚えていないな…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
msgid "This will keep me standing, if I need to fight."
msgstr "戦う必要があった時、これがあれば生き残らせてくれるだろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE"
msgid "That's revolting."
msgstr "極めて不快だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME"
msgid "There must be a better way."
msgstr "もっといい方法があるに違いない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
msgid "Some cracks can't be mended."
msgstr "一度壊れたら、二度と直せないものもある…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "What!? What do you want?"
msgstr "何だって！？一体どうしたいんだ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "You want some food?"
msgstr "何か食べたいのか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "He's finally asleep."
msgstr "ついに眠りについたか。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "He's so hungry!"
msgstr "ひどく腹を空かしている！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST"
msgid "I'm so sorry."
msgstr "かわいそうに。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
msgid "This is barely a mouthful."
msgstr "一口になるかならないか。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "My teeth are getting too old for this."
msgstr "これには私の歯じゃ太刀打ちできなくなってきた。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER"
msgid "I don't fear you, scoundrel."
msgstr "貴様ごとき恐れはしないぞ、悪党。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM"
msgid "Hmm. Where's Wilson?"
msgstr "ううむ。ウィルソンはどこだ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's fine."
msgstr "よかろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL"
msgid "Nice snowball."
msgstr "良い雪玉だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE"
msgid "That's strange. They must be new."
msgstr "変だな。新顔に違いない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks more like a science experiment than a fertilizer."
msgstr "こりゃ、肥料というより科学の実験みたいじゃないかね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED"
msgid "Ugh, the smell... can we just put it in the ground already?"
msgstr "おえっ、この臭い…もう地面にまいてもよかろう？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE"
msgid "Wonderful, it's putrefying."
msgstr "あっぱれだな。腐敗してるぞ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED"
msgid "It's reached the peak of its power... and its stench."
msgstr "力の頂点に達して…臭いも最高というわけだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "Ornery and tough as nails."
msgstr "凶暴な上に、機嫌も悪そうだ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "It's a spear. Yup."
msgstr "槍だ。その通り。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "I would never stoop to such things."
msgstr "私がそんなものに屈することは決してない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "How churlish."
msgstr "なんて無作法な。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "I can appreciate a finely crafted weapon."
msgstr "上質な武器は、よいものだ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING"
msgid "I can sense the power crackling within it."
msgstr "内側で弾ける力を感じるのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK"
msgid "I've been reduced to hauling my own foodstuffs."
msgstr "私は自分の食料を運搬する人夫になり果ててしまった。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI"
msgid "Bit of a kick in the pants."
msgstr "ちょっとしたカンフル剤だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC"
msgid "Keeps everyone from getting too close."
msgstr "人がお互いに近づきすぎないようにしてるわけだな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT"
msgid "My doctor said I shouldn't have too much."
msgstr "私の医者は摂りすぎるなと言ってたぞ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR"
msgid "I never was one for syrupy mush."
msgstr "私が甘ったれ野郎だったことはない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "Splat."
msgstr "ピシャッ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "It's mostly digestive system."
msgstr "体の大半が消化器官みたいなものだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Shhhh! It will wake up hungry."
msgstr "シー！お腹を空かして目をさますよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Good idea."
msgstr "良い考えだな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Hope it stays dead."
msgstr "大人しく死んでくれていればいいが。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Vile thing is coming back for more!"
msgstr "邪悪な怪物が蘇ってきたぞ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "They grow big here."
msgstr "ここでは奴らは大きく育つ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER"
msgid "Careful child, it's a slippery slope towards a career in the arts."
msgstr "気を付けろ。芸術の道に進んだら人生台無しだぞ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "Squishy."
msgstr "グニャグニャする。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "Distasteful."
msgstr "不快な。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "Spiders have such malleable wills."
msgstr "クモは実に順応性がある。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "How did that get down here?"
msgstr "あれはどうやってここに降りて来たんだ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "How did that get down here?"
msgstr "なぜこんなところに…？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "Maybe I'll just get out of her way."
msgstr "おそらく得策は、彼女の邪魔をしないことだね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That's a relief."
msgstr "これで一安心だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I hope she stays dead."
msgstr "死んだまま動かないでくれ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "I was worried about this."
msgstr "心配が現実となった。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "Creatures in this world evolve at a terrifying rate."
msgstr "この世界の生き物は、恐ろしい比率で進化する。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER"
msgid "I don't think that's one of mine."
msgstr "あれは私のじゃない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM"
msgid "Just in case I lose my mind entirely and want to heal those little pests."
msgstr "私の気が完全にふれて、あのちっこい害虫を治したいなんて思った時に使える。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "It's a tricky one."
msgstr "油断のならないやつだな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD"
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "ああせいせいした。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC"
msgid "How monstrous."
msgstr "これは怪物だな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING"
msgid "I'd rather not wake it."
msgstr "これは起こしたくない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT"
msgid "If only loud noises were really enough to deter them."
msgstr "騒音であいつらを駆除できるなら。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "Aggressive little thing, isn't it?"
msgstr "攻撃的なチビだろう？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "Splat."
msgstr "ピシャッ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a specialized form."
msgstr "特殊化された形だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "I don't want to wake that one."
msgstr "そいつを目覚めさせたくはない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER"
msgid "Well aren't you a delight!"
msgstr "おや、お前面白いじゃないか！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE"
msgid "It's probably covered in spider spit."
msgstr "クモのツバに覆われてるんだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "How vile."
msgstr "なんとも不愉快極まりない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "That used to be food until I wasted it."
msgstr "私が無駄にする前はそれは食料だった。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Magical red, and yet it holds no power of use to me."
msgstr "この赤は、魔力の色…利用価値はないがね"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "I hope it doesn't stain my jacket."
msgstr "上着が汚れないといいが…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON"
msgid "It reminds me of those infernal balloons."
msgstr "地獄の風船を思い出すなぁ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Hateful, ambulatory whimsy."
msgstr "フワフワ飛び回り、実にうっとうしい"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "I hope it doesn't stain my jacket."
msgstr "上着が汚れないといいが…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "How can a seed be so cheerful?"
msgstr "植物の種にしては、ずいぶんと陽気だ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "I hope it doesn't stain my jacket."
msgstr "上着が汚れないといいが…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SQUID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SQUID"
msgid "I hope they stay close. But not too close."
msgstr "あれはずっとそばにいてくれればいいが、決して近寄りすぎてはいけない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "An impressively condensed point of freezing magic."
msgstr "凍結マジックの印象的な凝縮点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "That should chase the shadows away."
msgstr "その影達を追い払ってくれるはず。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "More magic to add to the arsenal."
msgstr "武器庫にさらなる魔法がかかったのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "Wind power."
msgstr "風の威力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "Hmph. Impressive sleight of hand."
msgstr "ふむ。印象的な手の甲だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "This must be the work of an unseen hand."
msgstr "これは未知の手の仕業に違いない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING"
msgid "This must be the work of an unseen hand."
msgstr "これは未知の手の仕業に違いない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING"
msgid "Hmph. Impressive sleight of hand."
msgstr "ふむ。印象的な手の甲だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "Rocks. How dull."
msgstr "岩だ。なんて味気ない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "Stalagmite. How dull."
msgstr "石筍。なんて味気ない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "There is no limit to the power of shadows."
msgstr "闇の力というのは、計り知れないね"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "The Atrium's power restored his mind."
msgstr "闇の心臓の力で、心を取り戻したようだ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "A being of living fuel."
msgstr "悪夢の素が肉体を得た姿だ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC"
msgid "Some things can never be forgiven."
msgstr "決して許せないこともある。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP"
msgid "Now I suppose I'll have to go out and fetch what was stolen from me."
msgstr "さて、盗まれたものを取り返しに行く方がよいみたいだな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "The fewer statues the better, I say."
msgstr "これ以上、石像は必要ないと思うね"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Thank goodness, I thought it was another wretched statue of me."
msgstr "よかった…あれも私の石像かと思ったよ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "Not my best work."
msgstr "誇れる仕事ではないが。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER"
msgid "This place is really going to seed."
msgstr "この場所には本当に種が撒かれるのだろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "It seems silly now..."
msgstr "今見ると、実にこっけいだ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm. Stately."
msgstr "ふむ。荘厳だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "Her tragedy does not define her."
msgstr "惨劇が彼女のすべてではない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "She's still in there somewhere. I know it."
msgstr "彼女はまだどこかにいる。私にはわかる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "Needs something. Perhaps some long-stemmed roses..."
msgstr "何かが必要だ。おそらく長い茎のバラ..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "Someone should use this to clean something."
msgstr "これでこすれば、汚れがよく落ちそうだ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Why yes, you may call me the \"Captain\"."
msgstr "「はい」とはなんだ？君は私を「船長」と呼びたまえ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "Hard labor? Isn't that Winona's forte?"
msgstr "肉体労働？それはウィノナの特技じゃなかったかな？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "It's dripping with venom."
msgstr "毒が滴っている。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm appalled by the idea of sitting for some reason."
msgstr "座るというアイデアにはゾッとするよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Good. You sit. Forever."
msgstr "よし。座っていろ。永遠にな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Someone should really set this table."
msgstr "誰かがこのテーブルをセットすべきだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Who set this table? It's all wrong."
msgstr "このテーブルを置いたのは誰だ！？何もかも間違ってるのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN"
msgid "People have become so reliant on technology. Rather pathetic."
msgstr "人はテクノロジーに便りすぎたのだよ。なんと憐れなことか。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC"
msgid "Only the laziest person would think up this infernal device."
msgstr "こんな酷い装置を思いつくのは、よほど怠惰な人間だけなのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "A hat fit for a peasant."
msgstr "百姓にぴったりな帽子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "A meal fit for a king... or at least someone with a throne."
msgstr "玉座に座る者にふさわしい料理だよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STUFFING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.STUFFING"
msgid "Something to fill the void in my stomach."
msgstr "私の胃袋の隙間を埋める物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "It didn't put up much of a fight."
msgstr "あっけなく散ったものだね"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED"
msgid "They're all shrivelled up."
msgstr "完全乾燥しているな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "Doesn't look that succulent to me."
msgstr "「多肉」とはいえ、植物には変わりない"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "You're hard to kill. I respect that."
msgstr "まだ生きている…その根性は認めてやろう"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "How whimsical."
msgstr "なんて幻想的な。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "How annoying. It's locked."
msgstr "何てイライラするんだ。鍵がかかってるぞ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "Not the most refined design, but it's functional."
msgstr "最も優れたデザインではないが、機能はしてる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR"
msgid "It's buckling under the weight."
msgstr "重さに耐えられなくなっている。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
msgid "It couldn't withstand the pressure."
msgstr "圧力には耐えられなかったようだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE"
msgid "It will hold, for now."
msgstr "とりあえずは、大丈夫だろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE"
msgid "It's buckling under the weight."
msgstr "重さに耐えられなくなっている。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN"
msgid "Surprise, surprise."
msgstr "驚いた、実に驚いたよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE"
msgid "Hope it's as strong as it looks."
msgstr "見た目通り頑丈なことを願うよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "There is work to be done. For someone else."
msgstr "やらなくてはいけない用事があるのだよ。誰かのためにな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "There is work to be done. For someone else."
msgstr "やらなくてはいけない用事があるのだよ。誰かのためにな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
msgid "A very balanced meal, I suppose."
msgstr "栄養バランスの取れた食事だ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "It's no three-piece, but it's dapper enough."
msgstr "三つ揃えではないが、十分粋だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO"
msgid "How very... rustic."
msgstr "とてつもなく...田舎風だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA"
msgid "I can't even remember the last time I had a decent cup of tea."
msgstr "最後にまともな紅茶を飲んだのがいつだったかすら思い出せんよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Such power!"
msgstr "すばらしい力なのだよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
msgid "Humbug."
msgstr "ペテンだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "Must we go through this production for a little food?"
msgstr "ちょっと食糧を得るためにこれをやらなくちゃいけないのかね？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
msgid "I suppose I'll have to share."
msgstr "おそらく分け合わないといけないんだろうな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "The wrong place for this."
msgstr "これには不向きな場所だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "Can I really even call it a \"box\"?"
msgstr "これはそもそも「箱」と呼ぶに値するのか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "What forbidden fishing knowledge do you hold?"
msgstr "君が持ってる釣りに関する秘密の知恵とはどんなものかね？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "I suppose I could use a relaxing day of fishing."
msgstr "釣りでリラックスする日にしてもいいだろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "It's almost entirely sugar."
msgstr "ほぼ、砂糖の塊だ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "These were a failed experiment."
msgstr "失敗に終わった実験だった。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "Tallbirds are territorial because of these things."
msgstr "このために背高鳥たちは縄張り意識が強い。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "It tastes like broken dreams."
msgstr "敗れた夢のような味だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "It's getting tepid."
msgstr "ぬるくなってきてる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "We've got a live one here."
msgstr "生きている奴を捕まえたぞ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "Hot enough for ya?"
msgstr "おまえには熱すぎるか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "It's going to be a while."
msgstr "しばらくかかるだろうな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "Any moment now..."
msgstr "もういつでもおかしくない…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Well. That's tempting."
msgstr "ほう。魅惑的ではある。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "It's made of dirty beefalo hair."
msgstr "汚いビーファロの毛から出来ている。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS"
msgid "It's been a while since I've had a good Scotch egg."
msgstr "美味しいスコッチエッグを最後に食べたのはしばらくぶりなのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TAMALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TAMALES"
msgid "They've got a bit of kick to them."
msgstr "ちょっと刺激を受けたようだな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "It's less cute now that it's grown up."
msgstr "成長したらあまり可愛くなくなったな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "They sure do eat a lot."
msgstr "彼らは実によく食べるものだな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's much easier to deal with like this."
msgstr "こうなってる時はだいぶ楽に相手できる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "A hungry beast is a dangerous beast."
msgstr "腹をすかした獣は危険な野獣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "The fuel needs more focal points."
msgstr "その燃料にはもっと焦点が必要だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "That should do the trick."
msgstr "これでうまくいいくはずだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "It's alive!"
msgstr "大丈夫だ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "My beautiful machine is in pieces!"
msgstr "私の素晴らしいマシーンが粉々に！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "Now to turn it on."
msgstr "今スイッチを入れてみる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "It is still incomplete."
msgstr "まだそれは完了していない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "This is a box full of sadness and woe."
msgstr "悲しみと苦悩でいっぱいの箱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "This is used to agitate the humors."
msgstr "これは体液を揺り動かすのに使われる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "The gears in here are so small they turn the fabric of reality."
msgstr "ここにあるギアはかなり小さく、現実の構造を変えていく。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "This is the quantum field guard band."
msgstr "これは量子領域の保護周波数帯だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "Magic can do amazing things, when funneled through the right channels."
msgstr "これこそ、魔力の正しい使い方だよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "That's a bit burned for my taste."
msgstr "私からすると多少焦げている感じだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a bit rustic for my taste."
msgstr "私からすると多少いなか臭い感じだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "I'm glad the rest of it is still down there."
msgstr "その残りがまだその下にいてくれて嬉しい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "Ugh. This is so revolting."
msgstr "うっ！これは極めて不快だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "This is how they reproduce."
msgstr "やつらはこうやって再生したのだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "This one is odd."
msgstr "これは変だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "How deep does this go?"
msgstr "これはどの位深い所までいっているのか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "Babies?"
msgstr "赤ちゃん？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "Ugh! How can it live down there?"
msgstr "こんなところに生き物が生息するとはね…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN"
msgid "I'd bet it was that insufferable imp who brought it here."
msgstr "ここにそれを運んできたのはあのしゃくにさわる小悪魔に違いないのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON"
msgid "The fuel has taken hold."
msgstr "燃料が効いてきたようだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED"
msgid "Just what manner of magic is this?!"
msgstr "どんな魔法だというんだ！？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "My, this is some strange magic, even for me."
msgstr "ウム、これは私にとってさえも不思議な魔法なのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED"
msgid "Let it stay banished."
msgstr "消えたままにしておくのだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK"
msgid "Its power is coalescing."
msgstr "力が合わさりつつある。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT"
msgid "That seemed unnecessary."
msgstr "不要に見えたのだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "It's just my style."
msgstr "それが私流のやり方なのだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER"
msgid "How... unusual."
msgstr "なんと…おかしなことか。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "An exceedingly rare but useful material."
msgstr "かなり珍しいが、便利な材質。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET"
msgid "I'm glad I'm not an insect."
msgstr "自分が昆虫でなくて良かったと心底思うのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "Several of these piles could be combined to form a bigger piece."
msgstr "いくつか組み合わせれば、使えそうだ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "Curious. It smells like roses."
msgstr "バラの香り…いったいなぜ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED"
msgid "I didn't need his help anyway."
msgstr "いずれにせよあんな奴の助けなど要らないのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC"
msgid "This high status catcoon has a talent for finding the kits. I respect him only marginally more."
msgstr "この上級ニャライグマは子ネコを探す才能を持っているのだよ。ほんの少しだけ尊敬してやろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK"
msgid "Blasted, we weren't fast enough! Sniff faster, beast!"
msgstr "忌々しい。遅かったようだ！もっと早く嗅ぐんだ、獣！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY"
msgid "A-ha... there's a kitcoon afoot."
msgstr "なるほど…近くにコニャライグマがいるのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "There's nothing left to find."
msgstr "見つけられるものは何も残っていないみたいだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS"
msgid "Well done, great beast!"
msgstr "でかした！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY"
msgid "His nose may be good, but I doubt it's good enough to track that far."
msgstr "アイツの鼻は効くようだが、こんな遠くまでは嗅ぎ分けられないと思うのだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING"
msgid "He seems onto something. I shall let him take the lead."
msgstr "何かに気が付いたようだ。さあ、私を導いてみたまえ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE"
msgid "That ticoon is not working for me. Yet."
msgstr "あのトライグマはまだ私の役に立っていないのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED"
msgid "Nuisance."
msgstr "邪魔者。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE"
msgid "This will have to do."
msgstr "これでいいだろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED"
msgid "They're all shrivelled up."
msgstr "完全乾燥しているな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "What an abomination!"
msgstr "なんて忌まわしい！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "It is coursing with fungal power!"
msgstr "真菌の力で呪いをかけているぞ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "It's a dirt hole."
msgstr "これは土に掘った穴だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "Pitiful. I'll make short work of that 'shroom."
msgstr "哀れなものよ。私はあのキノコをさっさと片づけよう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "That looks filthy."
msgstr "あれは汚いな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOMATO"
msgid "It's a red, red tomato."
msgstr "真っ赤な真っ赤なトマトだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "It's a red, red roasted tomato."
msgstr "真っ赤な真っ赤なローストトマトだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "A preposterously sized tomato."
msgstr "非常識なサイズのトマト。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "私がこれを植えるのか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "Some fine haberdashery."
msgstr "素晴らしい雑貨小間物"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN"
msgid "Tall, dark and dapper."
msgstr "高さもあり色も暗くて粋なのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "It keeps Charlie at bay."
msgstr "Charlieを寄せ付けない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE"
msgid "I haven't had a meat pie since I left Liverpool."
msgstr "リバプールを出てからミートパイにはご無沙汰だったんだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "The magic beckons!"
msgstr "魔力に…引き寄せられる…！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Walking gets tiresome, you know."
msgstr "歩くのはおっくうだからね"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "The magic beckons!"
msgstr "魔力に…引き寄せられる…！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "An impure orange gem."
msgstr "不純物を含む橙玉石だ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "Nuts and berries. No bolts."
msgstr "ベリーとナッツ。ボルトはない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "What a brute!"
msgstr "なんて化け物だ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "I don't understand how it works, but it does."
msgstr "どうやって機能するというのは分からないが、ちゃんとする。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "Only the dumbest animals will fall for this."
msgstr "もっとも馬鹿な動物だけがこれに引っ掛かる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE"
msgid "Best laid traps."
msgstr "最高の罠だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Useless."
msgstr "くだらん。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD"
msgid "I still have a trick or two up my sleeve."
msgstr "まだいくつか策は残っているのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT"
msgid "Step right up, who wants to be raked over the coals?"
msgstr "さてさて、お灸を据えられたい人はいるかね？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM"
msgid "That should get the crowd warmed up."
msgstr "これなら観客も熱狂するだろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED"
msgid "Devious thing."
msgstr "ずる賢いヤツめ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
msgid "It's just a silly starfish."
msgstr "これはただのバカなヒトデだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "This one packs a wallop."
msgstr "これは強い効き目がある。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "I'm... sure I had my reasons when I placed this."
msgstr "私がこれを配置したのは、それなりの理由があった筈だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "It won't store anything now."
msgstr "今は何も納められない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A place to store loot."
msgstr "戦利品を納めておく箱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "A place to store lots of loot."
msgstr "戦利品をたくさんしまって置ける場所なのだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "Hmmm. Looks suspicious."
msgstr "うーん。なんだか怪しい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "I can't get through there."
msgstr "私はそこを通り抜けられない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION"
msgid "Looks like you're in a bit of a jam, pal."
msgstr "ジャムで邪魔してやろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING"
msgid "Ugh, it's so hot."
msgstr "チッ！熱すぎるのだよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED"
msgid "Someone should mine it now."
msgstr "誰か、今のうちに掘りたまえ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "What's that rock doing up there?"
msgstr "あの岩はあんなにも高いところで何をしているのかね？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING"
msgid "These things take forever."
msgstr "終わりが見えないのだよ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "Do I have to dig in the dirt? With my hands?"
msgstr "私が土を掘らないといけないのかね？素手で？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT"
msgid "It seems to have struck a chord."
msgstr "思い出したようだな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "These must have been heated to an incredible temperature."
msgstr "かなりの高熱にさらされたようだ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "Is that a crack about my age?"
msgstr "私が年寄りだとでも言いたいのかな？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "I'm not listening."
msgstr "こやつの言うことに耳を貸す気はないよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "I'm not touching that without several pairs of gloves."
msgstr "素手で触るなど、まっぴらだよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "Don't look at me like that."
msgstr "そんな目で見ないでもらいたい"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "Perhaps I'll invite the librarian for a nice mandrake tea."
msgstr "あの司書のご婦人を呼んで、お茶にするか…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "Charlie was the only one who ever kept me in check."
msgstr "チャーリー以外には負けたことがないよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "Charlie was the only one who ever kept me in check."
msgstr "チャーリー以外には負けたことがないよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "The product of a very immature magician, perhaps."
msgstr "三流マジシャンの作品だろう"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "A metaphor, perhaps."
msgstr "これは、何かの比喩かな…？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "Admittedly, it's difficult to maintain balance when you're on top."
msgstr "トップに立てば、足元はグラつきがちだ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "A complete and utter fraud..."
msgstr "どこからどう見ても、まがい物だよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "Eliminates the use of the phrase \"You scratch my back, I'll scratch yours.\""
msgstr "かゆいところに手が届くのは、よいことだ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "I know when I've been beaten."
msgstr "肌が「アワ立つ」ような恐怖を起こす装置かな…？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "The monster child gets tangled in this frequently."
msgstr "クモの少年が、よくこれに引っかかるよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "I was looking for that."
msgstr "ああ、ちょうど探していたんだ、よかった"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "It's been beheaded."
msgstr "首が切れているね"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "The strongman's wardrobe is brimming with them, judging from the odor."
msgstr "あの怪力男のようなニオイがする…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "This was important to one very specific person once."
msgstr "前の持ち主にとっては、宝だったんだろう"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "Finally. My suits were getting wrinkles. Wrinkles!"
msgstr "スーツがシワになっては困るからね"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "It is still beholden to the king."
msgstr "これはまだ王に見守られている。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "It is still beholden to the king."
msgstr "これはまだ王に見守られている。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "A tangled mess. Like life."
msgstr "解けない結び目…人生の象徴のようだ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "Not a pawn, but still a minion."
msgstr "ポーンではないが、ミニオンだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "Not a pawn, but still a minion."
msgstr "ポーンではないが、ミニオンだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "Amateur magic for children."
msgstr "子供のための素人マジック。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "The opposite of dapper."
msgstr "これは粋の真逆だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "I'm done tampering with magical oddities, thank-you."
msgstr "魔法のような奇妙な事柄を改ざんするのもう十分だ。ありがとう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "I'm not in the habit of imbibing strange liquids."
msgstr "私には変な液体を飲む習慣はないんだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "Permanently bared."
msgstr "永久にむき出し。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "I told you people, I am *not* a vampire!"
msgstr "言っただろう、私は吸血鬼*ではない*と！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "You are all ants in my eyes already."
msgstr "君たちは全員私の目の中のアリだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "What a tacky glove."
msgstr "なんて悪趣味な手袋だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "Don't look at me like that."
msgstr "そんな目で見ないでもらいたい"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "One hundred percent to scale."
msgstr "百パーセントウロコだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "I've no idea what that is."
msgstr "私にはあれがなんだかさっぱりわからん。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "It looks cheap."
msgstr "安っぽく見える。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "What use would I have of such a thing?"
msgstr "そんな物をこの私がどうするっていうのかね？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "Rosebud."
msgstr "バラのつぼみ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "At least it's not ragtime."
msgstr "少なくとも、ラグタイムじゃない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "Some harebrained invention of the scientist's, perhaps?"
msgstr "科学者の向こう見ずな発明なんじゃないか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "A toy for a child's mind."
msgstr "子供だましのおもちゃだよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "I might hide those in the robot's bedroll if I get bored."
msgstr "あのロボットの寝袋に仕込んでみるか…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "Not something a grown man should be caught playing with."
msgstr "大の大人が遊ぶものではないよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "I'd prefer a pocketwatch on a chain."
msgstr "鎖につなぐのは、懐中時計と決まっている"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "My suits don't deserve to be defaced with these tacky atrocities."
msgstr "私のスーツには、まるでふさわしくない！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING"
msgid "No! NOO!"
msgstr "いや！それだけはダメだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT"
msgid "All my ambitions go up in smoke."
msgstr "私の野望のすべてが煙になってしまった。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps I might reign again... as the king of fishing!"
msgstr "再び私が王になる日が来るかもしれない...釣り王としてだが！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}"
msgstr "重さ：{weight}\n捕獲者：{owner}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nEnjoy your moment while it lasts..."
msgstr "重さ：{weight}\n捕獲者：{owner}\n楽しめるうちに楽しみたまえ..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nBow down before your fishing master!"
msgstr "重さ：{weight}\n捕獲者：{owner}\n釣りのマスターに敬礼！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nImpressive, isn't it?"
msgstr "重さ：{weight}\n捕獲者：{owner}\nすごいだろう？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING"
msgid "...And now it's on fire."
msgstr "…今度は火事だっていうのか。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT"
msgid "Reduced to dust."
msgstr "すっかり灰になっちまったな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC"
msgid "Do we not have infinitely more pressing things to do?"
msgstr "こんなことよりも大事なことがあるんじゃないかね？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nHarvested on day: {day}\nA moderately impressive display"
msgstr "重量：{weight}\n収穫日：{day}\nそこそこ印象的な外観。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nHarvested on day: {day}\nI suppose it's an accomplishment."
msgstr "重量：{weight}\n収穫日：{day}\nたいそう立派といったところ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT"
msgid "The bar has been set low, I see."
msgstr "期待値が低く設定されているというわけか、なるほど。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER"
msgid "It's more of a fall vest."
msgstr "どちらかと言うと、秋のベスト。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER"
msgid "It's so hard to look fashionable in the winter."
msgstr "冬にお洒落に見せるのはえらく大変だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED"
msgid "At least the mucus burned off."
msgstr "少なくともその粘液は燃え尽きた。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER"
msgid "Full of summer mucus."
msgstr "夏の粘液でいっぱい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER"
msgid "The trunk thickens in the winter to hold more mucus."
msgstr "沢山の粘液を維持するために、冬の間は鼻を厚くしている。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED"
msgid "Tumble on, weed."
msgstr "回り続けろ、回転草。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION"
msgid "I despise getting my hands dirty."
msgstr "手を汚すのは私の好みではない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE"
msgid "A stone floor."
msgstr "石製の床。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS"
msgid "Turf."
msgstr "芝生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG"
msgid "Really, Higgsbury?"
msgstr "そうなのか、ヒグズベリー？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR"
msgid "That's a quality, high-pile carpet sample!"
msgstr "それは高品質で密度が濃い絨毯サンプルだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2"
msgid "What was wrong with my carpet?"
msgstr "私のカーペットの何が問題だったのかね？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE"
msgid "Turf."
msgstr "芝生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR"
msgid "That's my natural habitat."
msgstr "それは私の習性だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK"
msgid "Some quality stonework."
msgstr "高品質な石造りだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD"
msgid "A bit gaudy, but it certainly makes an impression."
msgstr "少々派手だが、確かに印象に残る。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS"
msgid "Turf."
msgstr "落葉樹の芝土"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT"
msgid "Turf."
msgstr "剥ぎ取った地面だ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT"
msgid "Dusty."
msgstr "埃っぽい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY"
msgid "It's warm, but quells flame."
msgstr "温かい…が、燃えることはないよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOREST"
msgid "Smells like mud."
msgstr "泥みたいな匂いがする。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS"
msgid "Turf."
msgstr "芝生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_GREEN"
msgid "Turf."
msgstr "剥ぎ取った地面だ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_MOON"
msgid "Turf."
msgstr "芝生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_RED"
msgid "Turf."
msgstr "剥ぎ取った地面だ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_GRASS"
msgid "Scratchy."
msgstr "チクチクする。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_MARSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_MARSH"
msgid "It's dripping all over."
msgstr "そこら中ボタボタ落ちている。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_METEOR
