msgstr "いつか、キミも大きく強くなるからね…んで、オレたちが食うよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4"
msgid "You are a very good plant."
msgstr "キミはうーんといい子だね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5"
msgid "We're always here when you need somebody to talk to!"
msgstr "誰かと話したい時には言ってね。オレたちずっとこの辺にいるからね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_THORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_THORNS"
