msgstr "一口で食べられちゃいそう！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER"
