#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC"
msgid "One of WX's backup chassis."
msgstr "WXの予備筐体のひとつですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY"
msgid "The automaton demonstrates an unusual attachment to their belongings."
msgstr "この機械は自らの持ち物に対して異常な執着心を見せていますね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT"
msgid "We are indebted to this intrepid little scout."
msgstr "この小さくも勇敢な偵察者にはお世話になっています。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP"
msgid "It permits the automaton to engage their foes from a distance."
msgstr "これがあれば、機械が遠距離から敵に応戦できますね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC"
msgid "Through signal transmission, the automaton may maneuver the aerial device and discharge electrical shocks."
msgstr "信号を発信することで、機械は浮遊装置を動かして、電撃波を放出することができるようです。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC"
msgid "The nutrient brick is inedible in its desiccated form."
msgstr "この栄養の塊は、乾燥した状態では食べられませんね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET"
msgid "The automaton has reconstituted spoiled food matter into a compact edible brick."
msgstr "機械は、食べることのできない食材を、小さくまとまった食用の塊へと再構築したようですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER"
msgid "It's been reconfigured to permit direct transfer of the entity into the chassis."
msgstr "これは実在物を筐体へと直接転送できるよう再構築されたものです。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC"
msgid "Once a repository whose capacity challenged the very laws of physics."
msgstr "許容量という側面で物理法則に挑んだ入れ物ですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.HELD"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER"
msgid "Do be careful with that, dear."
msgstr "取り扱いには気をつけなさい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY"
msgid "It's a straightforward instance of spectral machina possession, nothing more."
msgstr "端的に言って、これは霊的なマキナの憑依以外の何物でもありません。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC"
msgid "I suspect our resident handywoman might have assisted with its construction."
msgstr "うちの職人ならば、その組み立てを手伝うこともできたでしょう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING"
msgid "It appears to be searching for a suitable specimen to analyze."
msgstr "分析に適した検体を探しているようですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING"
msgid "It seems to be collecting data from that specimen."
msgstr "検体から情報を収集しているようですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM"
msgid "It appears to be dormant, for the moment."
msgstr "今は休止状態のようですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED"
msgid "It's finished compiling some more research, I believe."
msgstr "さらに調査が進んだようですよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER"
msgid "It studies enemies, calibrating WX's attack parameters."
msgstr "敵を分析し、WXの攻撃の媒介変数を調整するのですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER"
msgid "It is a rather industrious little gatherer."
msgstr "小さくてもかなり勤勉な収穫機ですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO"
msgid "Interesting... I conclude it requires further study."
msgstr "これは興味深い…さらなる研究が必要だという結論に至りました。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "This amulet is glowing at the mid 530 nanometer wavelength."
msgstr "このお守りは530ナノメートルぐらいの波長で発光していますよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM"
msgid "Perhaps it is similar to citrine."
msgstr "黄水晶に似ているかもしれませんね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE"
msgid "The geography of this place is less unknown each day."
msgstr "ここの地理は日に日に知られることが少なくなってきていますね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF"
msgid "Luckily the star is a manageable size."
msgstr "幸運なことに、この星の大きさならなんとか扱えますね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "How unfortunate."
msgstr "壊れている…残念ね"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I will require an offering."
msgstr "お供え物が必要になりますわね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's get to it then, shall we?"
msgstr "それじゃあ、始めましょうか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "How very charming!"
msgstr "とても可憐ですわね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB"
msgid "The judge might be able to give me some insight regarding its sense of style."
msgstr "審査員の方から、ぬいぐるみのお洒落のセンスについて、なにか意見をもらえるかもしれませんね。"

