msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED"
msgid "That should do it!"
msgstr "これは上手くいきそうだね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT"
msgid "Guess I'll have to start from scratch."
msgstr "最初っからやり直しだな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY"
msgid "Looks a bit dry to me."
msgstr "ちょっと乾いてるように見えるね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC"
