msgstr "あんたたち、スジ肉好きだね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "Still got a bit of a wait."
msgstr "まだちょっとかかるけど。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
