msgstr "あんたこれはやりすぎだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN"
