msgstr "あいつら、壊れてる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER"
