msgstr "あれって草でできたトカゲ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
