msgstr "コニャライグマのための素敵な家を作ろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS"
