msgid "This checks out. Ha!"
msgstr "チェックすべきチェックポイント、なんつって。ハハ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "Time to plot out a course for our little racers."
msgstr "うちの小さいレーサーのためにコースを作る時間だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "Hm. That's not gonna work."
msgstr "んー。ありゃダメだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Keep your eyes on the prize!"
msgstr "賞品だけを見てればいいんだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "Woo-wee! What a race!"
msgstr "ヒューヒュー！接戦だったね！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "Ha! Good race {winner}, but I'll get it next time."
msgstr "ハハ！いい勝負だったよ、{winner}。でも次はあたいが勝つよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "Now, where to put the finish line..."
msgstr "さて、フィニッシュラインはどこにしようかな..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "We all gotta start somewhere."
msgstr "みんなどこかから始めなくちゃいけないんだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "Better set up the race!"
msgstr "レースの日時を決めよう！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "Yikes, that was not up to code."
msgstr "うわっ。あれは規定違反だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "Still some room for improvement."
msgstr "まだ改良の余地があるね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "I think we've got a real winner on our hands!"
msgstr "あたいらの手の中に真の勝者がいるよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "Alright, let's see what I'm working with."
msgstr "いいよ。どんな結果が出るか見てみよう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "Time to see if my Carrat's up to snuff."
msgstr "あたいのニンジンが匂っても平気か試す時間だよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
