msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "Someone's gotta assemble this anchor, might as well be me."
msgstr "誰か、この錨を組み立てないと、っていうかあたいがやればいいか。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Guess I should've seen that coming."
msgstr "こうなることを予想しとくべきだったんだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "You want some charcoal to snack on?"
msgstr "木炭を食いたいのか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's see whatcha got!"
msgstr "お手並み拝見といこうか！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
