msgstr "漕ぐのに手を貸してほしかったんだ。爪でもいいぞ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Good thing I've got a great sense of direction."
msgstr "方向感覚が良くてよかったよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
