msgstr "あのハンドルが自動でああなるってことはない。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM"
msgid "Aw ain't that cute."
msgstr "なんてかわいらしい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT"
msgid "Here's to chargin' in headfirst."
msgstr "頭から突っ込もう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT"
