msgstr "真っ黒コゲになっちゃったヨ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "So you want the good stuff, huh?"
msgstr "なにか良いもんをよこせってのか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
