msgstr "何か噛むもの。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "A little rustic for my tastes, but functional enough."
msgstr "少し素朴すぎるけど、機能性は十分だね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
