msgstr "これにピッタリの場所をみつけてやろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "A little rustic for my tastes, but functional enough."
msgstr "少し素朴すぎるけど、機能性は十分だね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "It ain't much to look at without its light."
msgstr "灯りなしだと大した見た目じゃないね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "Gotta find a good place for it."
msgstr "これにピッタリの場所をみつけてやろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
