msgstr "ミミズども、パーティーのおめかししてきたね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Aww. I was using that."
msgstr "もう！使ってたのに。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I wonder what kinda offering it's waiting for?"
msgstr "どんな捧げものが欲しいんだ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "This little fella's a beacon of inspiration."
msgstr "この子はインスピレーションをもたらしてくれるな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
