msgstr "缶詰のオイルサーディンみたいに、畑が植物でギチギチじゃないか！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON"
msgid "I don't think this is the right season for it."
msgstr "たぶん、こいつは季節外れなんだよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED"
msgid "There's a whole laundry list of things wrong with this one."
msgstr "こいつの苦しみを全部書き写すなら、分厚いノートが必要になるよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "That's gonna start a fire!"
msgstr "それで火がつくよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "Low visibility causes workplace accidents!"
msgstr "視界不良は労災の原因になるんだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
