msgstr "家族で過ごした最後の休暇をまだ覚えてるよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "N-nice sky wyrm... Uh-oh."
msgstr "す、すごくきれいな空...あ～あ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
